<script>
(function(){
  function setH(){
    var b=document.querySelector('.navbar > .announcement_bar');
    if(!b||!b.offsetHeight)return;
    document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--announcement-h',b.offsetHeight+'px');
  }
  function init(){
    setH();
    var b=document.querySelector('.navbar > .announcement_bar');
    if(b&&window.ResizeObserver)new ResizeObserver(setH).observe(b);
  }
  if(document.readyState==='loading')document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',init);else init();
  window.addEventListener('load',setH);
  window.addEventListener('resize',setH);
})();
</script></div></div><main class="main-wrapper"><section id="header-1" class="section_header-1 theme-dark padding-top-md"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="header-1_layout"><div am-group="" class="header-1-content"><div data-wf--element-heading-title--main-alignment="d-left-m-left" STYLE="" class="heading-title"><div class="heading-title_title max-width-xxlarge"><div am-element="" class="rich-text-inherit_component"><div class="rich-text-inherit w-richtext heading-style-h1"><h1>Your data team, <strong>24/7.</strong></h1></div></div></div><div class="heading-title_description max-width-large"><div am-element="" class="rich-text-inherit_component"><div class="rich-text-inherit w-richtext text-size-medium"><p>Give anyone access to data agents managed by your data team. Get dashboards, reports, and figures ready to use.</p></div></div></div><div hide-slot-if-empty="" class="heading-title_slot"><div class="button-primary-wrap"><div><a modal="" data-wf--element-button--button-button---size="small" data-w-id="40df8398-5e5c-4d96-cf2e-dcb7dae468a6" href="https://app.cambercloud.com/login" target="_blank" class="button w-variant-9bfc922e-7694-a91c-2863-31a3cb5d6283 w-inline-block is-primary"><div aria-hidden="true">Try it free</div><div hide-slot-if-empty="" class="button_icon-slot w-variant-9bfc922e-7694-a91c-2863-31a3cb5d6283 flex-order-last"></div></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="header-1-image-wrap is-homepage"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/681a24354efe21a04772abd0/697b69fcb6b8eda80331673b_58d64f57b9b06c202fc45d25a29f1247_New%20Hero%20image.svg" loading="eager" alt="" class="header-1-image is-homepage"/></div></div></div></div><div class="header-1-blur-wrap"><div class="header-1-blur-1"></div><div class="header-1-blur-2"></div></div></section><div class="w-embed w-script"><style>.section_header-1 .header-1-image-wrap.is-homepage .header-1-image{display:none}</style>
<style>.cmh{--cmh-w:860;--cmh-acc:var(--_colors---blue-bright,#3da8ff);--cmh-acc-2:var(--_colors---blue-glow,#66b2ff);--cmh-blue:var(--_colors---blue-sky,#3a8ddb);--cmh-steel:var(--_colors---blue-azure,#4e90d9);--cmh-card:var(--_colors---navy-deep,#0a1e44);--cmh-bg:var(--_colors---black,#010c2d);--cmh-orange:var(--_colors---orange,#ffaf5d);--cmh-white:var(--_colors---white,#fff);--cmh-soft:var(--_colors---off-white,#e6e9f0);--cmh-pale:var(--_colors---blue-light,#b3d4f5);--cmh-muted:color-mix(in srgb,var(--cmh-white) 60%,transparent);
position:relative;width:44vw;max-width:880px;padding-top:10.5rem;color:var(--cmh-white);font-family:var(--_texts---font-family),sans-serif;text-align:left}
.cmh *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}
.cmh .vis{position:relative;width:100%;max-height:calc(100vh - 11.5rem)}
.cmh .stage{position:relative;margin-left:auto}
.cmh .stage:before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:-18% -25% -18% -10%;background:radial-gradient(closest-side,color-mix(in srgb,var(--cmh-acc) 22%,transparent),transparent);pointer-events:none;z-index:0}
.cmh .stage>*{position:relative;z-index:1}
.cmh .cmh-label,.cmh svg{font-family:var(--_headings---font-family-tertiary),var(--_texts---font-family),sans-serif}
.cmh .cmh-num{font-family:var(--_headings---font-family-primary),var(--_texts---font-family),sans-serif}
.cmh b{font-weight:600}
.cmh .stg{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:calc(var(--cmh-w)*1px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;transform-origin:0 0}
.cmh .st{opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px);transition:opacity .45s ease,transform .45s ease}.cmh .st.on{opacity:1;transform:none}
.cmh .fd{opacity:0;transition:opacity .5s ease}.cmh .fd.on{opacity:1}
.cmh .bub{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--cmh-acc) 12%,transparent);border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--cmh-acc-2) 50%,transparent);border-radius:16px;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--cmh-white)}
.cmh .av{flex:0 0 auto;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--cmh-blue);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--cmh-white)}
.cmh .dots{display:inline-flex;gap:4px}.cmh .dots i{width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--cmh-acc-2);animation:cmhbl 1s infinite}.cmh .dots i:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.15s}.cmh .dots i:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.3s}
@keyframes cmhbl{0%,100%{opacity:.25}50%{opacity:1}}
.cmh .caret{display:inline-block;width:2px;height:1em;background:var(--cmh-white);margin-left:2px;vertical-align:-3px;animation:cmhcb .8s steps(1) infinite}@keyframes cmhcb{50%{opacity:0}}
.cmh .chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--cmh-acc-2) 55%,transparent);border-radius:999px;padding:10px 18px;font:inherit;font-size:16px;line-height:1.2;color:var(--cmh-soft);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--cmh-acc) 8%,transparent);cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap;transition:background .2s,border-color .2s}
.cmh .chip:hover,.cmh .chip.hov{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--cmh-acc) 20%,transparent);border-color:var(--cmh-acc);color:var(--cmh-white)}
.cmh .chip:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--cmh-acc-2);outline-offset:3px}
.cmh .arr{display:inline-block;transition:transform .2s}.cmh .chip:hover .arr,.cmh .chip.hov .arr{transform:translateX(3px)}
.cmh .replay{display:none!important}
.cmh .q1{transition:opacity .4s ease,transform .45s ease,font-size .4s ease,padding .4s ease}.cmh .q1 .av,.cmh .q2 .av{transition:width .4s,height .4s,font-size .4s}
.cmh .q2{display:none!important;transition:opacity .4s ease,font-size .4s ease,padding .4s ease}
.cmh .fu .q1{font-size:16px!important;padding:6px 6px 6px 16px!important;opacity:.7}.cmh .fu .q1 .av{width:26px;height:26px;font-size:12px!important}
.cmh .fu .q2{display:flex!important;transform-origin:0 0}.cmh .chip.gone{opacity:0;transition:none}
.cmh .cone,.cmh .fcl{transition:opacity .5s ease,stroke .5s ease}.cmh .fu2 .cone{opacity:0}.cmh .fu2 .fcl{opacity:.4;stroke:var(--cmh-steel)}.cmh .fu2 .df.on{opacity:0}
.cmh .gpc{transform-box:fill-box;transform-origin:50% 0;transition:transform .5s ease}.cmh .fu3 .gpc{transform:scaleY(0)}.cmh .gpt{transition:opacity .4s}.cmh .fu3 .gpt{opacity:0;transition:opacity .15s}.cmh .p30{transition:opacity .25s}
.cmh .q3{display:none!important}.cmh .b3 .q3{display:flex!important;transform-origin:0 0}
.cmh .b3 .q1{font-size:13px!important;padding:4px 4px 4px 12px!important;opacity:.5}.cmh .b3 .q1 .av{width:20px;height:20px;font-size:10px!important}
.cmh .b3 .q2{font-size:16px!important;padding:6px 6px 6px 16px!important;opacity:.7}.cmh .b3 .q2 .av{width:26px;height:26px;font-size:12px!important}
.cmh .lc{transition:opacity .3s ease}.cmh .uc{opacity:0;transition:opacity .3s ease;pointer-events:none}.cmh .b3 .lc{opacity:0}.cmh .b3 .uc{opacity:1}
.cmh .shr{border-radius:999px;padding:4px 10px;margin:-4px -10px;transition:color .5s ease,background .5s ease}.cmh .shr.hl{color:var(--cmh-acc);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--cmh-acc) 10%,transparent)}
.cmh .wfc{display:none!important}
.cmh.nt *{transition:none!important}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.cmh .st,.cmh .fd{transition:none}}
@media screen and (max-width:991px){.cmh{width:min(640px,calc(100vw - 2.5rem));max-width:none;margin:2.5rem auto 0;padding-top:0}.cmh .vis{max-height:none}.cmh .stage{margin:0 auto}}
@media screen and (max-width:767px){.cmh{--cmh-w:520}
.cmh .bub{white-space:normal}
.cmh .q1,.cmh .q2,.cmh .q3{font-size:26px!important}
.cmh [data-s=from]{font-size:22px!important}
.cmh [data-s=card]>div:first-child{font-size:19px!important}
.cmh .ctl{font-size:21px!important}.cmh .rp{font-size:16px!important;line-height:20px!important}
.cmh [data-s=sum]{font-size:20px!important;line-height:1.45!important}
.cmh [data-s=ctx]{font-size:16px!important}
.cmh .chip{font-size:22px;padding:16px 24px;white-space:normal;text-align:left}
.cmh svg text{font-size:22px}.cmh svg text.cmh-num{font-size:48px}}
</style>
<div class="cmh" aria-label="Animated example: a Camber data agent answers a question about Q4 revenue with a chart">
<div class="vis"><div class="stage"></div></div>
<template>
<div class="stg">
<div class="bub st q1" data-s="q" style="align-self:flex-end;padding:10px 10px 10px 22px;font-size:22px"><span class="qt">Are we on track to hit our Q4 target?</span><span class="av" style="font-size:16px;font-weight:600">A</span></div>
<div class="bub q2" style="align-self:flex-end;padding:10px 10px 10px 22px;font-size:22px"><span>What would it take to close the gap?</span><span class="av" style="font-size:16px;font-weight:600">A</span></div>
<div class="bub q3" style="align-self:flex-end;padding:10px 10px 10px 22px;font-size:22px"><span>What’s driving Corvane’s drop?</span><span class="av" style="font-size:16px;font-weight:600">A</span></div>
<div class="bub st" data-s="from" style="align-self:flex-start;gap:12px;padding:8px 20px 8px 8px;font-size:17px"><span class="av"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--cmh-white)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 8V4H8"></path><rect width="16" height="12" x="4" y="8" rx="2"></rect><path d="M2 14h2M20 14h2M15 13v2M9 13v2"></path></svg></span><span>From <span style="color:var(--cmh-acc)">acme.analyst</span></span><span class="dots" style="margin-left:4px"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></div>
<div class="st" data-s="card" style="border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--cmh-steel) 35%,transparent);border-radius:20px;background:var(--cmh-card);padding:20px 24px 24px;box-shadow:0 40px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.4)">
<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:15px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);padding:0 2px 14px"><span>Chart ⌄</span><span class="shr" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="18" cy="5" r="3"></circle><circle cx="6" cy="12" r="3"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="19" r="3"></circle><path d="m8.6 13.5 6.8 4M15.4 6.5l-6.8 4"></path></svg>Share with team</span></div>
<div style="background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--cmh-bg) 55%,transparent);border-radius:14px;padding:20px 20px 12px">
<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;margin-bottom:10px;height:22px"><div class="ctl cmh-label" style="font-size:17px;color:var(--cmh-white);white-space:nowrap">Ending ARR · Q4 2026</div><div class="fd rp cmh-label" style="flex:0 0 auto;border:1px solid var(--cmh-orange);border-radius:999px;padding:2px 10px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;line-height:16px;color:var(--cmh-orange);white-space:nowrap">Churn risk 82%</div></div>
<div class="chart" style="position:relative"></div>
</div>
<p class="st" data-s="sum" style="margin-top:18px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--cmh-white);text-wrap:pretty">Tracking to <b style="font-weight:600">$102.6M</b> against a $104M target. The gap is almost exactly two at-risk renewals: <b style="font-weight:600">Corvane Systems</b> and <b style="font-weight:600">Wexmoor Group</b> ($1.43M ARR).</p>
<div class="st" data-s="ctx" style="margin-top:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:15px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6)"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--cmh-acc)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>Using Finance’s ARR definition · CS churn model v3</div>
<div class="st" data-s="chip" style="margin-top:16px"><button type="button" class="chip fuc">What would it take to close the gap? <span class="arr" style="color:var(--cmh-acc)">→</span></button></div>
